From 041a4ed54897bd71aad1ac0e9e1e021889d83071 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <81541646+RyanTheTide@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:47:50 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 04/15] avd-fw: queue tagged frames and chain VP to PP

Define the open queue ABI, fetch packetized programs through PIODMA into SRAM, and feed the VP FIFO from CM3 with completion backpressure. Preserve legacy IRQ messages before queue mode and document host mapping, ownership and reset requirements.

Build each variant with isolated objects, include v5-t2 in Meson, and test the native scheduler and emulated ARM transport.
